    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Ju Kai Bei’s hard qi Gu groups with Bai Ning Bing’s vitality Gu and Fang Yuan’s atmosphere Gu as related to qi path, and qi path Gu worms can alternate between form and formless. Ancient qi path appeared earlier than strength path; when it flourished, eight out of ten Gu Masters walked it, then it declined and strength path replaced it.",
