  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Ju Kai Bei puts the Gu away and sighs that it is hard qi Gu rather than strength qi Gu. Yan Tu answers that ancient qi path has already disappeared, that strength qi Gu is extinct, and that obtaining hard qi Gu is already great luck. Ju Kai Bei adds that if it had been strength qi Gu, his battle strength would surge by two or three times.",
